    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630790/extras/00ed00de9991dcc7985bfbc997338aac.poster.avif?t=1753994310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630790/extras/00ed00de9991dcc7985bfbc997338aac.webp?t=1753994310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cosmic Colonists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Survive. Thrive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish a thriving interstellar colony on a hostile alien planet in this deep survival-strategy game. Mine resources, manage settlers, and defend against catastrophic disasters as you evolve from a fragile outpost to a self-sustaining civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Build and Expand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a vast colony with modular bases, farms, mines, and research labs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Manage and Optimize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance oxygen, food, and energy systems to avoid collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2604\ufe0f Survive in the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats: Meteor showers that destroy everything in their path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events: Supply Ship Crash, Mysterious Artifacts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2c Research and Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech tree with over 100 upgrades, drone automation, and energy shields.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630790/extras/00ed00de9991dcc7985bfbc997338aac.poster.avif?t=1753994310\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630790/extras/00ed00de9991dcc7985bfbc997338aac.webp?t=1753994310\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cosmic Colonists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Survive. Thrive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish a thriving interstellar colony on a hostile alien planet in this deep survival-strategy game. Mine resources, manage settlers, and defend against catastrophic disasters as you evolve from a fragile outpost to a self-sustaining civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Build and Expand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a vast colony with modular bases, farms, mines, and research labs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Manage and Optimize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance oxygen, food, and energy systems to avoid collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2604\ufe0f Survive in the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats: Meteor showers that destroy everything in their path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events: Supply Ship Crash, Mysterious Artifacts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2c Research and Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech tree with over 100 upgrades, drone automation, and energy shields.</strong></p>",
